  <item>
    <title>水元素滋养第二脉轮好好睡觉</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66456d36251bd96e6ca71656</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66456d36251bd96e6ca71656</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 16 May 2024 02:19:33 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>睡前读📖《脉轮全书》，第二脉轮对应的是水元素，代表着人的情绪、欲望等。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="920">15:20</a> 为了达到更高的层次，是不是应该禁欲？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1050">17:30</a> 超越身体还是跟随身体的指示？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1170">19:30</a> 平时可以做的水的练习：好好喝水、淋浴，观察江河湖海等</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1673">27:53</a> 第二脉轮连接水元素静心冥想</span></p><span></span><p><span>左中右脉图解：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmP1t37COi1VpYFy9udVkvI6huXh.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>脉轮交汇处与七脉运行：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnbhIrl_8n-mnCLS922dVS7JvUSA.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>第二脉轮位置如图：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FunKuM9qzDB9MOQhGsikbonD5wTo.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/luZxm7xfNNkYkElQ1N9xMgWjGv6h.m4a" length="40812574" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:42:01</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fv5P9A6ATfTSewv3m7vHb7b6pozo.png"/>
