    <guid isPermaLink="false">65b9a175cace72dff85606ef</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 11 Feb 2024 13:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>🐱🍼 新手养猫就开启了Hard模式，从没睁开眼就开始养他。前三个月很煎熬，不会大小便，每三个小时就要喂奶。到长大以后可以自主吃饭上厕所以后就解放了，每天睡16个小时的它活得真的好开心啊。羡慕极了。</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵 BGM特别挑了一期猫猫听了以后会很放松的背景音乐</span><a href="https://music.163.com/song?id=436495892&amp;userid=1630257775" data-url="https://music.163.com/song?id=436495892&amp;userid=1630257775"><span>Scooter Bete's Aria</span></a><span> 作曲 David Teie，如果你家有猫猫可以一起听，有呼噜呼噜的声音，好放松。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fv2LDJAwSazI6cPHpPJJjnaQPda1.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>🐱睡觉要用小爪爪捂住眼睛，遮光。护住鼻头，保暖。</span></p><span></span><p><span>🍠 我们甚至在小红书给他开了一个账号</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5658207bb8c8b4432bffee2e?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5a647ba94eacab59c28ca8ae&amp;apptime=1706664497" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5658207bb8c8b4432bffee2e?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5a647ba94eacab59c28ca8ae&amp;apptime=1706664497"><span>@我是kiwi</span></a></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lqGMbCvoi88HguWFQIGD-IX5-tNI.m4a" length="17340397" type="audio/mp4"/>
